      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bristol%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Minot–Sleeper Library, opened 1885, was the first purpose‑built public library in New Hampshire’s Lakes Region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
